      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of transient right bundle branch block with left anterior hemiblock during Prinzmetal's angina is reported. Selective coronary arteriography revealed 90% narrowing on the proximal left anterior descending coronary artery; the left ventriculogram was normal. Transient ischemia of the proximal His-Purkinje system is the probable mechanism of this pattern."},
